[ti:Gehra Hua]
[ar:Arijit Singh, Shashwat Sachdev, Irshad Kamil]
[al:Dhurandhar]
[by:Antigravity Lyrical Cloud Studio]
[00:24.30]Tu agar meri, dil hawale tere
[00:29.08]Tu agar meri, main hoon tera
[00:33.08]Betaab-sa mohabbat ka tu inqalaab hai
[00:40.76]Mera jahaan teri baahon mein khwaab, khwaab hai
[00:48.76]Gehra hua, gehra hua
[00:56.16]Rang aashiqui gehra hua
[01:04.14]Gehra hua, gehra hua
[01:11.86]Dariya dua gehra hua
[01:19.00]Tera hua...
[01:22.80]Tu agar meri, yeh hawayein teri
[01:26.58]Tu agar meri, saari raahein teri
[01:30.72]Tu agar meri, main hoon tera
[01:41.86]Palkein jhapakta hai aasmaan
[01:54.82]Laakhon farishton ki hai tu jaan
